WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.900
Until you flip this card, you both know the answer.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.100
And you don't.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:04.900
Flip it.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.300
Congratulations.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.100
You've collapsed the wave function.

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.450
Missed it? It's back in ten minutes.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.250
Knew it? It waits for months.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:16.700
1,198 cards, all waiting to be observed.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.050
The few things that are certain live in the Constants tab.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.750
Download PhysicsRecall on the App Store.
